    "chunk_text": "\u00fe\u00e6t ys pluralis numerus on Lyden, & on Englisc Anadiplosis ys on \u00fe\u00e6re fiftan stowe amearcod; \u00fe\u00e6t ys on Lyden iterata dupplicatio, & on Englisc Anaphora ys \u00fe\u00e6t syxte hiw; \u00fe\u00e6t ys on Lyden gecweden relatio uel repetitio, & on Englisc & swa ys: Vox (17425) Domini in uirtute; uox Domini in magnificentia. Sume u\u00f0witan hata\u00f0 \u00feis hiw epanaphoram, \u00fe\u00e6t ys super relationem. Epanalemsis ys on \u00fe\u00e6re seofe\u00f0an stowe. \u00deis hiw by\u00f0 gehw\u00e6r funden on gewritum \u00feonne se cwyde by\u00f0 on foreweardum \u00feam uerse & eft on Epizeuxis ys on \u00fe\u00e6re eahto\u00f0an stowe, \u00fe\u00e6t ys on Lyden superconiunctio, & on Englisc getwynnys, On o\u00f0re wisan ys \u00feis hiw genemned palilogie, \u00fe\u00e6t ys on Lyden repetitio sermonis, & on Englisc. Paronomasia, id est denominatio on Lyden. \u00deis hiw by\u00f0 gesett on myslicum andgite, swylce ic \u00feis do to bisne: Amans & amens, & semens & Amans homo by\u00f0 lufwende man, & amens by\u00f0 awoffod, & semens by\u00f0 sawende, & sementes by\u00f0 F\u00e6gere \u00feis hiw geglengde Isaias se witega, \u00fea he \u00feus giddiende cw\u00e6\u00f0: Expectaui ut faceret \u00deas word swy\u00f0e f\u00e6gere ge\u00few\u00e6rl\u00e6ca\u00f0 on Ebreiscre spr\u00e6ce, swa we \u00fe\u00e6t her willa\u00f0 \u00feam r\u00e6dere Iudicium on Lyden, & on Englisc dom, & on Ebreisc mesaphaat: iustitia on Lyden, & on Englisc F\u00e6gere he gemetegode \u00fe\u00e6ra n",
